    project: phase-gated-compound-sparse
    status: failed
    review_mode: full
    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: ''
    focus: 'Key improvements since last dream: (1) recency scoring-independent control
      confirms phase gradient is attention-score-specific (three-way dissociation:
      importance/random/recency), (2) full 8-condition LLaMA cross-architecture validation
      (n=250, all PASS), (3) expanded related work (50 citations), (4) "why not causal"
      self-defense in discussion, (5) dense baseline phase stats. Evaluate whether
      these address the previous dream''s main criticisms: narrow novelty, circularity
      concern, thin references, no figures, no practical method.'
